WEBVTT

00:01:56.871 --> 00:02:02.079
I decided to expand my land

00:02:02.079 --> 00:02:06.163
to increase my harvest.

00:02:09.121 --> 00:02:11.121
AY: Most of the world's poor are farmers,

00:02:11.121 --> 00:02:13.163
and so when farmers
become more productive,

00:02:13.204 --> 00:02:14.496
then they earn more income,

00:02:14.538 --> 00:02:16.746
and mass numbers of people
move out of poverty.

00:02:16.746 --> 00:02:19.704
They produce more food
for their communities and end hunger.

00:02:19.746 --> 00:02:21.829
From the farmer's perspective, basically,

00:02:21.871 --> 00:02:23.954
One Acre Fund provides a small loan

00:02:23.954 --> 00:02:26.621
that makes these simple
farm inputs affordable.

00:02:26.663 --> 00:02:28.829
So this is, for example,
professional seed,

00:02:28.871 --> 00:02:31.996
which is 100 percent natural,
locally produced;